---
import { QuickExample } from "../components/QuickExample";
import DocsLayout from "../layouts/DocsLayout.astro";
---

<DocsLayout title="문서">
  <section class="grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2">
    <div>
      <p class="font-semibold text-indigo-600">@kokoa/clotho</p>
      <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight">JSON으로 애니메이션을 작성하고 어디서나 재생하세요.</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">같은 문서를 React, Vue, DOM, SVG, Node.js와 GIF에서 사용합니다.</p>
      <div class="flex gap-3">
        <a class="rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-white no-underline" href="/docs/getting-started">시작하기</a>
        <a class="rounded-lg border border-slate-300 px-4 py-3 font-semibold no-underline dark:border-slate-700" href="https://clotho-editor.shinkeonkim.com/">Editor 열기</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="not-prose overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-sm dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-950">
      <QuickExample client:load />
    </div>
  </section>
</DocsLayout>
